    <string name="section_guide">How it works</string>
    <string name="guide_tap_whale">Tap the whale: opens the bubble and refreshes; repeated taps only restart the timer and never close it</string>
    <string name="guide_tap_bubble">Tap the bubble: first tap switches to a random line, the next tap closes it; a cost bubble closes on a tap</string>
    <string name="guide_drag">Drag the whale: it snaps by drop point, to the matching edge when within a quarter of the screen, likewise vertically, otherwise it stays put; mirroring on the left edge</string>
    <string name="guide_no_multi_tap">There is no double tap or long press action; double tapping never opens the app</string>
    <string name="guide_settings_entry">Open settings from the app icon or the notification, not from the pet</string>
    <string name="guide_content_modes">Bubble content: tapping the whale shows balance and usage, a balance drop shows the last turn cost, tapping the bubble switches to a random line</string>

